{"id":96835320332752,"type":"album","name":"Circles","artist":"Mac Miller","year":2020,"weight":13,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/205582-circles-1.jpg","aoty":82,"aoty_user":86,"sputnik":3.82,"yt":"Z2mg3aDtJa0","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/mac-miller/circles","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/205582-mac-miller-circles.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/343843/Mac-Miller-Circles/"},"desc":"Circles is the sixth studio album by American recording artist Mac Miller. It was being worked on by Miller before his death in 2018, and was released posthumously on January 17, 2020, by Warner Records. Production was completed by Jon Brion. Circles was supported by two singles: \"Good News\" and \"Blue World\". The album received widespread acclaim from critics and debuted at number three on the US Billboard 200, earning 164,000 album-equivalent units during its first week, making it Miller's biggest week for an album. At the time of his death, Miller was \"well into\" the recording process of Circles. ."},"artist_ref":{"id":152411785470368,"name":"Mac Miller","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":185670346256268,"type":"genre","name":"rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3782,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":136937573393074,"type":"genre","name":"hip hop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1554,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":30122583811636,"type":"genre","name":"Soul","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":645,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":98720889157055,"type":"genre","name":"Neo-Soul","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":251,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":156194853339605,"name":"RYM Top — R&B — Neo-Soul","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":8,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":202254272888124,"name":"RYM Top — R&B — Soul","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":26,"year":null,"note":null,